  "details": "In the latest beta, a new feature was added that allows users to move their arms by pressing the middle mouse button. However, this has made things quite inconvenient for me, as I have always used the middle mouse button to rotate objects I am holding.\n\nI understand that it is still possible to rotate held objects using keyboard inputs, but this method feels less intuitive. Since it requires me to take my hand off the mouse, even making small adjustments to the rotation of items such as pens or cups feels cumbersome.\n\nI would really appreciate it if you could add a setting that allows users to switch the middle mouse button back to its original functionality.\n\n---\n\n今回のベータでマウス中央の押下操作により腕を動かせる機能が追加されましたが、今まで掴んだアイテムの回転をマウス中央の押下で行ってきたのでとても不便になりました。\n\nキー入力での回転が可能なのは理解していますが、直感的ではなく、マウスから一度手を離す必要がある関係上、ペンやコップなどのちょっとした回転には煩わしく感じます。\n\nマウス中央の機能を従来のものとしても使えるような切り替えの設定をさせてもらえると嬉しいです。",
